    "turn_text": "You mentioned immigration, that was a major issue on the campaign trail. Some people are painting last night on CBS's 60 Minutes, Donald Trump's statement that he no longer wants to deport the estimated 11 million or so illegal immigrants in the United States, at least not all of them, as walking back his immigration stance. Was that how you viewed it? Are you concerned that it's he might be walking back as immigration stance a little bit? No, not at all.",
