    "turn_text": "That's a decision for Donald Trump to make, and he'll make that, I'm sure, on an individualized basis for the people he thinks he needs to fill out his cabinet and to run our government. At the lower levels, at the assistant secretary level, or even more junior, there are a lot of talented people who have experience in the government. who may not have been active in the campaign, but who can be put in positions, again, at the lower levels to help make the machinery of government right, to make sure that each department and agency is doing its job and delivering on Donald Trump's promises. At the higher levels, that's really a decision for Donald Trump to make on a case-by-case basis.",
