    "turn_text": "Like they cover most campaigns, but even more so. They covered trying to give the Democrat a boost, but even more so for Hillary Clinton and against Donald Trump. That's been the case forever though, Republicans who complain about media bias or complaining at the night because it's dark, much better to light a candle than shake your fist.",
